  "text": "1\nCommunity\nClassroom\nCalendar\nMembers\nMap\nLeaderboards\nAbout\nChase AI Community\n1\n1\nMatthias Goscinski\n6d • ⚡General discussion\nHey! I'm Matthias 👋\nHead of Creation at a mobile gaming studio — we've crossed 1 billion downloads, small team, fully independent. I've been deep in AI tooling for a while now, mostly on the creative production side: Claude for writing and agents, Figma Weave for image/video pipelines, custom MCP servers for connecting things that don't naturally talk to each other.\nI'm less \"starting from zero\" and more \"trying to figure out the next layer\" — so I'm here to see how other people are structuring their workflows and w... See more\nLike\n4\n1 comment\n1\nMark Peterson\n• 3d (edited)\nhow has the experience using claude for your pipelines been? Do you feel more productive? Do you consider your outputs production quality? If yes what specific manual inputs did you have to add to get there? How different is your ai workflow from your typical workflow for work work?\n0\nReply\n1\n\n\n\n\nChase AI Community\nskool.com/chase-ai-community\nGo from learning to earning. Join Chase AI+👇\nUpgrade to Chase AI+\n57.5k\nMembers\n245\nOnline\n3\nAdmins\nINVITE PEOPLE\nLeaderboard (30-day)\n1\nVitalii Hryhorenko\n+51\n2\nCharles Dove\n🔥\n+23\n3\nCyber Ai\n+22\n4\nSam Alder\n🔥\n+16\n5\nJonathan Wilson\n+15\nSee all leaderboards\nPowered by",
